{"title":"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f635b011f9b30c74226102734997da3ffbf816d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b9321edbbf1f120b4fdedd1edbeaa59b91059978.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{4}{3}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" /> and passes through the origin, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. The line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35edf96252eba7402bbd237547e8ce10796778d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41ed9764877afbbe4af71f580dbe5e3c3ebd00ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{1}{2}x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" /> and crosses the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f635b011f9b30c74226102734997da3ffbf816d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35edf96252eba7402bbd237547e8ce10796778d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_A\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part A\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part A</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_B\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part B\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part B</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part C (page does not exist)\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part C</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_D&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part D (page does not exist)\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part D</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.p